                        <chunk name="InputParam" index="5">
                          <items count="6">
                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Result time to probe: empty = latest written time, a number = that written time, all = every written time still on disk. Times that were purged (Keep Time Steps) cannot be probed. FluidX3D results also accept avg (mean over every written time) and avg:START-END (mean over a window in seconds, e.g. avg:120-360 to skip the spin-up transient).</item>
